696 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 254 0 R
/T (      MANY PEOPLE PLAY MANY GAMES AT THE SAME TIME. GAMING COMPANIES, BRANDS, OR EVEN DIGITAL DISTRIBUTION PLATFORMS LIKE GOOGLE PLAY STORE CREATE GAME PASSES WHERE AN INDIVIDUAL PLAYER CAN SUBSCRIBE TO GAIN ACCESS TO A ROSTER OF PREMIUM GAMES FOR A MONTHLY COST. THIS IS A HUGE MARKET FOR PLAYERS WHO PLAY GAMES REGULARLY ESPECIALLY IF THEIR LOVED GAMES ARE INCLUDED IN THE GAME PASS. DUE TO THE ADVANCEMENTS IN TECHNOLOGY, MOST GAME PASSES ARE NOW FREE FROM DEVICE RESTRICTIONS AND CAN BE ACCESSED BY THE PLAYERS IN MORE THAN ONE TYPE OF DEVICE. HOWEVER, GAMES ARE BEING RELEASED AT DIFFERENT TIMES OF THE YEAR AND TRENDS MOVE UNEXPECTEDLY EACH MONTH. THIS IS WHY THE ROSTER OF GAMES INCLUDED IN THE GAME PASS SHOULD BE UPDATED REGULARLY.)
/E (      MANY PEOPLE PLAY MANY GAMES AT THE SAME TIME. GAMING COMPANIES, BRANDS, OR EVEN DIGITAL DISTRIBUTION PLATFORMS LIKE GOOGLE PLAY STORE CREATE GAME PASSES WHERE AN INDIVIDUAL PLAYER CAN SUBSCRIBE TO GAIN ACCESS TO A ROSTER OF PREMIUM GAMES FOR A MONTHLY COST. THIS IS A HUGE MARKET FOR PLAYERS WHO PLAY GAMES REGULARLY ESPECIALLY IF THEIR LOVED GAMES ARE INCLUDED IN THE GAME PASS. DUE TO THE ADVANCEMENTS IN TECHNOLOGY, MOST GAME PASSES ARE NOW FREE FROM DEVICE RESTRICTIONS AND CAN BE ACCESSED BY THE PLAYERS IN MORE THAN ONE TYPE OF DEVICE. HOWEVER, GAMES ARE BEING RELEASED AT DIFFERENT TIMES OF THE YEAR AND TRENDS MOVE UNEXPECTEDLY EACH MONTH. THIS IS WHY THE ROSTER OF GAMES INCLUDED IN THE GAME PASS SHOULD BE UPDATED REGULARLY.)
/Pg 10 0 R
>>
endobj
697 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 256 0 R
/T ( COMPANY A WANTS TO KNOW WHICH GAMES ARE CURRENTLY IN THE TREND AMONG PLAYERS AND UPDATE THEIR CURRENT GAME PASS EXCLUSIVE GAMES LIST TO A NEW ONE THAT MATCHES THE SHIFTING TRENDS. THIS PAPER AIMS TO KNOW WHICH LATEST GAMES ARE MOST PREFERRED TO BE PLAYED AMONG PEOPLE AND THE CURRENT POPULAR GAME PREFERENCES OF DIFFERENT PLAYERS.)
/E ( COMPANY A WANTS TO KNOW WHICH GAMES ARE CURRENTLY IN THE TREND AMONG PLAYERS AND UPDATE THEIR CURRENT GAME PASS EXCLUSIVE GAMES LIST TO A NEW ONE THAT MATCHES THE SHIFTING TRENDS. THIS PAPER AIMS TO KNOW WHICH LATEST GAMES ARE MOST PREFERRED TO BE PLAYED AMONG PEOPLE AND THE CURRENT POPULAR GAME PREFERENCES OF DIFFERENT PLAYERS.)
/Pg 12 0 R
>>
